    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Crowley are delighted to bring to the market this four bedroom semi-detached property, located in a quiet residential cul-de-sac, close to Westport town and Quay with Croagh Patrick views, that has been extended and very well maintained throughout by its current owners.\n\nWith a floor area of approximately 128sqm/1,378sqft, ground floor comprises of an entrance hall with WC, a spacious living room with solid fuel stove and double doors into a bright kitchen/dining room. In 2017, the owners extended the ground floor of the property adding a pantry/utility room and a master bedroom with an en-suite and fully fitted walk in wardrobe. \n\nFirst floor consists of two double bedrooms (one en-suite) with built in wardrobes and a single bedroom that is currently utilised as a fully shelved dressing room and a main bathroom. The property is presented in excellent condition throughout and comes to the market in a genuine turnkey condition. Ideally suited to a wide range of purchasers, it would make an excellent family home, retirement property, holiday home, or investment opportunity.\n\nExternally, the property has a tarmac driveway to the front with parking for up to 4 cars. Side access is available and leads to a generous sized enclosed garden with a Steeltec Garden Room, ideal for relaxing and entertaining, a large block shed with electricity that offers many uses including a personal gym or office space and a fully shelved steeltec tool shed. \n\nLocation\nThe property is located only a stone's throw away from Westport Quay, which is renowned for many good quality restaurants and bars. Westport town and all its amenities including shops, primary/secondary schools, sports clubs and public transport is one kilometre away and can be accessed via the nearby Westport Greenway walking/cycle path.\n\nOFFERS IN EXCESS 439,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall (inc. staircase & WC) - 4.4m x 1.88m\nTiled floor, painted and carpeted staircase\n\nLiving Room - 4.4m x 3.85m\nSemi-solid oak floor, solid fuel stove, curtains\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.86m x 3.56m\nTiled floor and backsplash, painted shaker kitchen, wooden formica worktop, integrated dishwasher, fridge/freezer, range cooker, extractor fan, double door to garden, blinds\n\nPantry - 2.15m x 1.5m\nTiled floor, fully shelved\n\nUtility Room - 2.5m x 1.65m\nTiled floor and backsplash, shaker kitchen units, washing machine, dryer, sink\n\nBedroom One - 4.25m x 4m\nDark walnut laminate floor, blinds\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2.24m x 2.2m\nDark walnut laminate floor, fully shelved\n\nEn-Suite - 2.24m x1.95m\nFully tiled, shower, heated towel rail, wc, whb unit\n\nWC - \nTiled floor, wc, whb\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 2.92m x 2.09m\nCarpeted floor, attic access\n\nBedroom Two - 3.64m x 3.15m\nOak laminate floor, built in wardrobes, curtains\n\nEn-Suite - 0.81m x 2.2\nTiled floor and backsplash, shower, wc, whb unit\n\nBedroom Three - 3.3m x 3.28m\nOak laminate floor, built in wardrobe, curtains\n\nBedroom Four - 2.545m x 2.455m\nOak laminate floor, fully shelved, currently utilised as dressing room/storage\n\nBathroom - 2.095m x 1.745m\nFully tiled, bath/shower, wc, whb unit\n\nSteeltec Garden Seomra Room - 2.79m x 1.97m\nWood decking floor, outdoor furniture\n\nShed/Gym/Office - 4.5m x 3.487m\nOak laminate floor, stira to floored attic\n\nSteeltec Shed - 3.57m x 2.4m\nFully shelved\n\n"
